OL,3,GNEWSAFestival ferry link suspended
OL,4,Aafter fault
OL,5,
OL,6,FA passenger ferry service between
OL,7,FPortsmouth and the Isle of Wight has
OL,8,Fbeen suspended after a problem with the
OL,9,Fvessel's exhaust was found.
OL,11,FWightlink said the FastCat between
OL,12,FPortsmouth Harbour ` Ryde Pier Head was
OL,13,Fcancelled up to and including the 16:15
OL,14,FBST crossing. The ferry is used by
OL,15,Fpeople travelling from the Isle of
OL,16,FWight to the Victorious Festival.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
