OL,3,GNEWSAFestival ferry link suspended
OL,4,Aafter fault
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ferry firm said the hovercraft
OL,7,Fbetween Ryde and Southsea was set to
OL,8,Frun extra crossings with Wightlink
OL,9,Ftickets being accepted and passengers
OL,10,Fcan also use the Portsmouth-Fishbourne
OL,11,Fcar ferry instead.
OL,13,FOn Saturday several hovercraft
OL,14,Fcrossings between Ryde and Southsea
OL,15,Fwere cancelled following a technical
OL,16,Fissue and bad weather conditions.
